## End-to-end bot flow (Automations / laptop worker)

1. **`jira-my-tickets`** query 5 → VPN candidates + verify checklist  
2. No approve yet → Slack approve request only  
3. On ✅ / explicit approve → this skill: `create` (or delete→create)  
4. Poll bridges/jobs → scrape traces → Slack with 1Password links  
5. Optionally comment on Jira with pipeline URL (no share secrets in Jira if policy forbids)

Worker: run from repo that contains these skills (`agent worker start` with `--worker-dir` pointing here). Keep `glab` + Atlassian MCP authenticated on that machine.

## Safety

- Mutate only with approval (chat or Slack ✅)
- Prefer delete→create for recreate
- Never invent emails or 1Password URLs
- Do not commit secrets / share links into the repo
- On auth errors, stop and ask human — do not retry blindly
